      "message": "Depends if the host sends HOST_SLEEP_EVENT_S0IX_RESUME on abort. The EC assumes if HOST_SLEEP_EVENT_S0IX_SUSPEND is received, HOST_SLEEP_EVENT_S0IX_RESUME will be received to resume.\n\nI think calling lpc_s0ix_resume_restore_masks when a hang is detected could resolve this. I created b/228857046 to track.",
